./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:5:**范围**：design.md / scripts/exp324b_train_head.py（逐行）/ 复用 helper exp324_dino.py / repo loss/triplet_loss.py / repo datasets/sampler.py / loss/make_loss.py / 远程数据与 pose_data 实地核对
