./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:12:不是。exp324 frozen 已通过 kill-switch（重遮挡 pose part-MaxSim 1.86 mAP，×3.4 超整图 0.55，且均匀网格对照只 0.67 几乎不涨 → 涨点来自"姿态锚定"机制本身）。exp324b 是这个正信号的**自然下一步**：在冻结特征上训最小投影头，验证"冻结 FM 特征能否被轻量头拉到可用 ReID 判别空间"。单变量隔离干净（baseline = exp324 frozen 同 pipeline，只多了一个 413K 线性头 + BNNeck + 分类器）。这是范式/参数角度的合法探索，不属于禁止回退方向（不是 visibility 小改、不是 retrieval-side scorer 微变体、不是 test-time trick）。重点应放在实现正确性，下文逐行审。
./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:24:文件:`scripts/exp324b_train_head.py:171-189, 294-305`。
./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:38:**M2 — `CACHE_QG`（exp324/_cache）是 dead 变量，query/gallery 部位特征会重新抽取，不复用 exp324 已缓存的 patch token，浪费 ~5 分钟 + 重复显存峰值。**
./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:39:文件:`:61, 462-465`。`CACHE_QG` 定义后从未使用；`extract_part_features('query'/'gallery', …, CACHE_TRAIN, …)` 把 query/gallery 部位特征写进 `CACHE_TRAIN`（即 exp324b/_cache_train），全程重跑 DINO forward。exp324 已有 `patch_query/gallery_224x448_n{N}.npy`（13.9G gallery），本可复用 patch 直接 `build_part_pose` 省去 DINO forward。**不是正确性 bug**（结果一致），但浪费算力且 `CACHE_QG` 误导读者以为有复用。建议：要么删掉 dead 变量并在注释说明"重抽以保证 head 见到与训练同分布的 raw 部位均值"，要么真的复用 exp324 patch 缓存。无需阻断，但应清理。
./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:62:文件:`:231-265`。P 个不同 id（`avail[:P]` 取自 shuffle 后的全 id 列表，保证 distinct）；每 id `rng.choice(pool, K, replace=len(pool)<K)`（<K 张有放回，与 sampler.py:43-44 一致）；`num_batches = num_imgs // bs`（每 epoch floor(15618/64)=244 batch）。`avail` 耗尽时重灌全 id 重 shuffle（比 repo 的"id 池耗尽即停"更充分利用数据）。每 batch 恰好 P×K=64。正确。注意：repo sampler 保证一个 epoch 内每张图大致被用一次，本 sampler 是"按 id 无放回轮转 + id 内有放回"，分布略不同但对 PK-triplet 无害。
./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:85:baseline = exp324 frozen 同 pipeline（同分辨率 224×448、同 grid、同 POOL_RADIUS=1、同 5 部位划分、同 part-MaxSim 距离、同 heavy 阈值 8）。exp324b 唯一新增变量 = 轻量头（proj+BN+cls）+ 训练。单变量干净。design.md 消融计划（pose vs grid 头、线性 vs MLP、ID-only vs ID+tri）合理。
./experiments/exp324b/claude_review.md:104:- M2：清理 dead 变量 `CACHE_QG` 或真复用 exp324 patch 缓存。
./experiments/exp324b/_codex_review2.log:14:Re-review (round 2) of exp324b after fixing the round-1 blocking issue. Files: scripts/exp324b_train_head.py and experiments/exp324b/design.md (imports helpers from scripts/exp324_dino.py). Round-1 BLOCKING finding (both Claude and Codex): train/test objective mismatch — the projection head was supervised only via the global masked-mean feature (ID CE + triplet) but the key metric is per-part part-MaxSim on L2-normalized projected parts, so per-part vectors stayed weakly aligned. FIX APPLIED: added a shared per-part ID classifier (self.part_classifier) applied to each VISIBLE part's projected vector, weight --part_weight (default 0.5, =0 gives a global-only ablation arm); total loss = global ID CE + global soft-margin triplet + part_weight*per-part ID CE. Also added: cosine LR scheduler (was none), BN params excluded from weight decay via param groups (ndim<=1), PKSampler num_batches=max(1,...) guard, removed dead CACHE_QG. VERIFY: (1) is H1 genuinely resolved — does per-part CE on un-normalized projected parts adequately supervise the L2-normalized per-part cosine space used by part-MaxSim, or is there still a residual gap? (2) line-by-line re-check the changed regions for new bugs: part-loss computation + vmask, param-group split correctness, scheduler.step placement, 7-element step() return unpacking consistency across dry-run/epoch prints/meters; (3) confirm previously-correct triplet/sampler/eval/same-cam-exclusion not broken; (4) design.md now matches code. Output: Verdict (approve / needs-attention) + findings with severity.
